{"id":"T1036","name":"Masquerading","tactics":["stealth"],"description":"Adversaries may attempt to manipulate features of their artifacts to make them appear legitimate or benign to users and/or security tools. Masquerading occurs when the name or location of an object, legitimate or malicious, is manipulated or abused for the sake of evading defenses and observation. This may include manipulating file metadata, tricking users into misidentifying the file type, and giving legitimate task or service names. Renaming abusable system utilities to evade security monitoring is also a form of Masquerading.","status":"defended","claimed_by":[{"id":"CIS-2.5","title":""},{"id":"CIS-3.3","title":""},{"id":"CIS-4.1","title":""},{"id":"CIS-6.1","title":""},{"id":"CIS-6.2","title":""}],"live_rules":[{"id":"45eb2ae2-9aa2-4c3a-99a5-6e5077655466","title":"Suspicious Computer Account Name Change CVE-2021-42287","level":"high","requires":["windows/security"]},{"id":"54f0434b-726f-48a1-b2aa-067df14516e4","title":"Password Protected ZIP File Opened (Suspicious Filenames)","level":"high","requires":["windows/security"]},{"id":"cfeed607-6aa4-4bbd-9627-b637deb723c8","title":"New or Renamed User Account with '$' Character","level":"medium","requires":["windows/security"]}],"dead_rules":[{"id":"0c92f2e6-f08f-4b73-9216-ecb0ca634689","title":"PUA - Potential PE Metadata Tamper Using Rcedit","level":"medium","requires":["windows/process_creation"]},{"id":"12fbff88-16b5-4b42-9754-cd001a789fb3","title":"CodePage Modification Via MODE.COM To Russian Language","level":"medium","requires":["windows/process_creation"]},{"id":"1327381e-6ab0-4f38-b583-4c1b8346a56b","title":"Potential Command Line Path Traversal Evasion Attempt","level":"medium","requires":["windows/process_creation"]},{"id":"15b75071-74cc-47e0-b4c6-b43744a62a2b","title":"Suspicious Process Start Locations","level":"medium","requires":["windows/process_creation"]},{"id":"1a1ed54a-2ba4-4221-94d5-01dee560d71e","title":"Renamed CreateDump